// The notification half of BLE-beacon notifications. The scanning half lives in
// XiaomiParts (mithorium-common), which shares the system UID - and Settings
// locks every notification channel of UID 1000 ("System notifications cannot be
// modified"). Posting from this ordinary-UID app is what lets the per-status
// channels be edited like any app's. Not privileged, and NOT platform-signed:
// DefaultPermissionGrantPolicy grants POST_NOTIFICATIONS as SYSTEM_FIXED to every
// platform-signed system app, and a fixed grant locks every channel again
// (PreferencesHelper.updateFixedImportance). releasekey is the ordinary app key.
android_app {
    name: "BeaconNotifier",

    srcs: ["src/**/*.java"],
    resource_dirs: ["res"],
    certificate: "releasekey",
    sdk_version: "system_current",
}
